  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.discovered": "NEW STORM DISCOVERED",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.found": "...Wait. WHAT is that?",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.overworld": "A storm... standing on the horizon, lightning crawling all through it.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.nether": "The air is shimmering. It's like staring into a furnace.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.end": "Space bends around it... like looking through warped glass.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.first.deep_dark": "Not a sound. Even my own heartbeat feels too loud.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.overworld": "Frost, thaw, then a sudden bloom... the ground under it never stays the same.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.nether": "It flares up... and a wave of heat rolls out across the ground.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.end": "Those seams in the air... step into one, and you walk out of the other.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint.deep_dark": "It's listening. Every step, every blow... it hears them all.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.overworld": "Where the ground glows blue, lightning strikes next.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.nether": "They say gear left in its heart comes out tempered by the flame.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.end": "Arrows hang in the air beneath it. Even gravity forgets itself.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hint2.deep_dark": "Better tread softly. Sneaking, it might just let me pass.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.remember": "I won't forget *this* one.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands": "My hands...",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky": "Wait.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.quiet2": "*Too* quiet.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands2": "They're *tingling*.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.hands3": "What is HAPPENING to me?",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky2": "The sky...",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.sky3": "What's wrong with the SKY?",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.split2": "THE SKY SPLIT OPEN!",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.soon2": "No, no, no—",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.alive2": "I can *feel* it breathing.",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.inside2": "...But what's INSIDE?",
  "cutscene.horizons_unbound.fade": "...It's fading.",
